<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
	<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
	<title><%= status === 404 ? "Página não encontrada" : "Algo deu errado" %> | MangaShelf</title>
	<style>
		* {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}
		:root {
			--text: #3d4e66;
			--background: #edf1f5;
			--foreground: #fafafa;
			--gray: 221, 230, 238;
			--red: #ec294b;
			--primary: #1e3a8a;
			--accent: #3db4f2;
		}
		.dark {
			--text: #cbd5e1;
			--background: #151d32;
			--foreground: #1e293b;
			--gray: 30, 42, 56;
		}
		body {
			background-color: var(--background);
		}
		a {
			text-decoration: none;
			color: currentColor;
		}
		.container {
			margin: auto;
			max-width: 1520px;
		}
		.page-content {
			min-height: 100vh;
			position: relative;
		}
		.not-found {
			margin: auto;
			margin-bottom: 2em;
			margin-top: 2em;
			border-radius: 10px;
			position: relative;
			font-size: 1em;
			padding: 70px 2em;
			color: var(--text);
			background-color: var(--foreground);
			text-align: justify;
			box-shadow: 2px 2px 7px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.282);
			max-width: 90vw;
		}
		.not-found h1 {
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
			text-align: center;
			font-size: 2rem;
		}
		.not-found p {
			margin-top: 1rem;
			line-height: 1.5rem;
		}
		.not-found--link {
			color: var(--accent);
		}
		.call-to-action-container {
			display: flex;
			position: absolute;
			gap: 20px;
			bottom: 0;
			left: 50%;
			translate: -50% 50%;
		}
		.call-to-action {
			padding: 10px;
			background-color: var(--primary);
			color: white;
			font-weight: bold;
			border-radius: 3rem;
		}
		.error-page__reload {
			border: none;
			font-family: inherit;
			font-size: 1rem;
			cursor: pointer;
		}
		.error-page__details {
			margin-top: 1rem;
			padding: 1rem;
			border-radius: 5px;
			background-color: rgba(var(--gray), 1);
			color: var(--red);
			font-family: monospace;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			white-space: pre-wrap;
			overflow-wrap: anywhere;
		}
		@media only screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
			.page-content {
				padding-top: 4rem;
			}
			.container {
				padding-left: 100px;
				padding-right: 100px;
			}
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<script>
		try {
			const theme =
				localStorage.getItem("theme") ||
				(window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches ? "dark" : "light");
			document.body.classList.add(theme);
		} catch (e) {}
	</script>
	<main class="page-content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="not-found">
				<% if (status === 404) { %>
					<h1>404</h1>
					<p>Parece que você tentou acessar uma página não existente</p>
					<p>Verifique o endereço do link e tente novamente</p>
				<% } else { %>
					<h1>Ops!</h1>
					<p>Parece que algo deu errado ao carregar essa página</p>
					<p>Tente recarregar a página para ver se o problema se resolve</p>
				<% } %>
				<p>
					Caso o erro persista nos mande detalhes na área de
					<a href="/feedback" class="not-found--link">feedback</a>
					e tentaremos resolver o quanto antes
				</p>
				<% if (error) { %>
					<pre class="error-page__details"><%= error.message %></pre>
				<% } %>
				<div class="call-to-action-container">
					<% if (status === 404) { %>
						<a href="/" class="call-to-action">Volte para a pagina principal</a>
					<% } else { %>
						<button type="button" class="call-to-action error-page__reload" onclick="window.location.reload()">
							Recarregar a página
						</button>
					<% } %>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
